# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# This repo tracks ONLY the general fitting framework:
#   Fitter.py  DataCardMaker.py  Utils.py  doFit.py  fit_signalshapes.py
#   interpolation.py  makePostfitPlot.py  run_fit_adaptive.py
#   convert_signal_h5.py  CMS_lumi.py  tdrstyle.py
#   dimuonX_config.json (example config)
#
# Particular APPLICATIONS of the framework live under analyses/<name>/, each
# with its own .gitignore for its own outputs (see analyses/dimuonX/.gitignore
# for an example). Nothing analysis-specific belongs at this top level.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
